<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 03:26:35 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-212</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们还要被关在这里多久？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;帖子&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-212"&gt;《地堡谈话：让我们谈谈本周我们做过和没有涵盖的所有事情》&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:57:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/bunker-talk-lets-talk-about-all-the-things-we-did-and-didnt-cover-this-week-212</guid></item><item><title>处于史诗般的愤怒第二轮的边缘吗？</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/on-the-brink-of-epic-fury-round-two</link><description>&lt;p&gt;以色列空军的行动、船只的动向、不祥的信息等等都表明与伊朗的战争有可能再次爆发。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/on-the-brink-of-epic-fury-round-two"&gt;史诗般的愤怒第二轮边缘的帖子？&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:19:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/on-the-brink-of-epic-fury-round-two</guid></item><item><title>波音子公司将推动通用原子公司 FQ-42 CCA 无人机产量提升</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/general-atomics-fq-42-cca-drone-production-ramp-up-to-be-boosted-by-boeing-subsidiary</link><description>&lt;p&gt;通用原子公司目前正在与 Spirit Defense 合作，帮助满足美国空军在未来六年内对战斗机无人机不断增长的需求。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/general-atomics-fq-42-cca-drone-production-ramp-up-to-be-boosted-by-boeing-subsidiary"&gt;通用原子公司 FQ-42 CCA 无人机产量将由波音子公司提升后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:39:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/general-atomics-fq-42-cca-drone-production-ramp-up-to-be-boosted-by-boeing-subsidiary</guid></item><item><title>丹麦将购买圣歌弹药和联合打击导弹进行双重远程打击推进</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/denmark-to-buy-anthem-munitions-joint-strike-missiles-in-dual-long-range-strike-push</link><description>&lt;p&gt;随着北约加强其波罗的海侧翼，地面和空中发射的武器将为丹麦提供深入敌后打击的全新选择。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/denmark-to-buy-anthem-munitions-joint-strike-missiles-in-dual-long-range-strike-push"&gt;丹麦购买国歌弹药、双远程打击推进中的联合打击导弹的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:59:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/denmark-to-buy-anthem-munitions-joint-strike-missiles-in-dual-long-range-strike-push</guid></item><item><title>美国空军确认轰炸机可能在空对空作战中发挥重要作用</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/usaf-confirms-bombers-could-have-a-major-air-to-air-combat-role</link><description>&lt;p&gt;除了扩大战斗机机队和建立CCA部队之外，轰炸机现在被视为另一种潜在的空对空资产。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/usaf-confirms-bombers-could-have-a-major-air-to-air-combat-role"&gt;美国空军确认轰炸机可能发挥主要空对空作战作用的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:31:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/usaf-confirms-bombers-could-have-a-major-air-to-air-combat-role</guid></item><item><title>中国工厂的四架 KJ-3000 雷达喷气机即将批量生产</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/four-kj-3000-radar-jets-at-chinese-factory-point-to-serial-production</link><description>&lt;p&gt;KJ-3000是中国迅速扩张的机载预警和控制机群中能力最强的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/four-kj-3000-radar-jets-at-chinese-factory-point-to-serial-production"&gt;四架 KJ-3000 雷达喷气机在中国工厂进行批量生产的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:46:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/four-kj-3000-radar-jets-at-chinese-factory-point-to-serial-production</guid></item><item><title>首次出现地面发射“生锈匕首”低成本巡航导弹</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/ground-launched-rusty-dagger-low-cost-cruise-missile-seen-for-the-first-time</link><description>&lt;p&gt;首次公开展示该导弹的地面发射配置是在其制造商扩大生产之际。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/ground-launched-rusty-dagger-low-cost-cruise-missile-seen-for-the-first-time"&gt;首次亮相的陆基“生锈匕首”低成本巡航导弹首先&lt;/a&gt;出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:09:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/ground-launched-rusty-dagger-low-cost-cruise-missile-seen-for-the-first-time</guid></item><item><title>A-4“超级”天鹰在欧洲天空中扮演坏人</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/a-4-super-skyhawks-playing-the-bad-guys-in-european-skies</link><description>&lt;p&gt;A-4 天鹰在七十年前首飞，因其作为冷战“红空”侵略者的角色而闻名，直到今天，它仍在欧洲履行这一使命。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/a-4-super-skyhawks-playing-the-bad-guys-in-european-skies"&gt;A-4“超级”天鹰在欧洲天空中扮演坏人，&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:30:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/a-4-super-skyhawks-playing-the-bad-guys-in-european-skies</guid></item><item><title>尽管战火不断，伊朗“鹰44”地下空军基地的建设并未停止</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/construction-of-irans-eagle-44-underground-airbase-hasnt-stopped-despite-war</link><description>&lt;p&gt;卫星图像描绘了伊朗空军基地的地下机库和滑行道隧道遭到袭击后的新建筑和清理后的残骸。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;尽管&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;战乱&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/construction-of-irans-eagle-44-underground-airbase-hasnt-stopped-despite-war"&gt;，伊朗“鹰44”地下空军基地的建设并未停止&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:11:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/construction-of-irans-eagle-44-underground-airbase-hasnt-stopped-despite-war</guid></item><item><title>美国陆军“海军”如何提高其在太平洋的舰艇的自主性</title><link>https://www.twz.com/sea/how-the-u-s-armys-navy-aims-to-go-more-autonomous-with-its-vessels-in-the-pacific</link><description>&lt;p&gt;陆军希望购买多达 100 艘新型 USV，并为现有有人驾驶船只增加自主能力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/sea/how-the-u-s-armys-navy-aims-to-go-more-autonomous-with-its-vessels-in-the-pacific"&gt;《美国陆军“海军”如何提高其在太平洋的船只的自主性&lt;/a&gt;》一文首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:30:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/sea/how-the-u-s-armys-navy-aims-to-go-more-autonomous-with-its-vessels-in-the-pacific</guid></item></channel></rss>